===Accomplishments===
[[File:Discurso de vitória na reeleição de Marcelo Rebelo de Sousa (Lusa - Aconteceu em 2021).png|thumb|Marcelo Rebelo de Sousa delivering his victory speech after being reelected.]]
[[Marcelo Rebelo de Sousa]] won the third highest vote margin ever in a presidential election in Portugal since democracy was [[Carnation Revolution|restored]], only behind [[Mário Soares]]' 70.35 percent in [[1991 Portuguese presidential election|1991]] and [[António Ramalho Eanes]]' 61.59 percent in [[1976 Portuguese presidential election|1976]].<ref>{{cite news |last1=Machado |first1=Alexandra |last2=Filipe |first2=Celso |last3=Santiago |first3=David |last4=Curvelo |first4=Pedro |title=Marcelo obteve o terceiro melhor resultado de sempre em presidenciais |url=https://www.jornaldenegocios.pt/economia/politica/eleicoes/detalhe/portugueses-voltam-pela-10-vez-para-escolher-o-presidente-da-republica |access-date=27 January 2021 |publisher=Jornal de Negócios |date=25 January 2021}}</ref> He was also the first candidate ever to win the vote in all [[Portuguese municipalities|municipalities]],<ref>{{cite news |last1=Camilo |first1=Diogo |title=Marcelo é o primeiro Presidente da República a vencer em todos os concelhos do país |url=https://www.sabado.pt/portugal/detalhe/marcelo-e-o-primeiro-presidente-da-republica-a-vencer-em-todos-os-concelhos-do-pais |access-date=27 January 2021 |publisher=Sábado |date=25 January 2021}}</ref> and win in 3083 out of 3092 parishes of the country.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Tânia |first1=Pereirinha |title=As nove freguesias — em 3.092 — onde Marcelo não ganhou |url=https://observador.pt/2021/01/25/as-nove-freguesias-em-3-092/ |access-date=27 January 2021 |publisher=Observador |date=25 January 2021}}</ref>

[[Ana Gomes]] became the most voted woman ever in a presidential election in Portugal, beating [[Marisa Matias]]' previous record of 10.12 percent in [[2016 Portuguese presidential election|2016]], and the first to get second place.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Lusa |title=Presidenciais: Ana Gomes é a mulher mais votada de sempre em Portugal |url=https://visao.sapo.pt/atualidade/politica/presidenciais-2021/2021-01-25-presidenciais-ana-gomes-e-a-mulher-mais-votada-de-sempre-em-portugal/ |access-date=27 January 2021 |publisher=Visão |date=25 January 2021}}</ref>

